WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Surface hierarchy. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Trace primary and secondary volumes

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Surface hierarchy distinguishes major volumes from secondary transitions and small details. Contrast and edge flow guide attention.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Trace the largest uninterrupted surface first, then mark where a crease redirects the eye toward a wheel arch.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Layer order critique

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: A view supports interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance alone.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Trace primary and secondary volumes
